<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Akapen main window (spec §7.4-4 / §9 M2 / M2-D / M2-F — WinUI 3 shell).

  Layout expanded from M2-A (Open/Save + SwapChainPanel + StatusBar) to add the
  M2-D tool/color/size + undo/redo UI that mirrors the mac shell's SidePanelView
  (apps/mac/Sources/AkapenApp/SidePanelView.swift + ContentView.swift), then
  M2-F's Prev/Next frame-stepping buttons:

    ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
    │ [Open] [Save] | [Pen] [Eraser] | [Undo] [Redo] | [◀Prev][Next▶]│ Toolbar (Grid.Row 0)
    ├──────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────┤
    │                                              │ サイズ  10 px │
    │                                              │ [────●──]     │
    │           SwapChainPanel                     │ ─────────      │  Grid.Row 1
    │           (RenderSurface)                    │ 色             │
    │                                              │ ● ● ● ● ●     │
    │                                              │ ● ● ● ● ●     │
    ├──────────────────────────────────────────────┴────────────────┤
    │ status text …                    pressure warning (orange)   │  StatusBar (Grid.Row 2)
    └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Design notes on M2-D scope:
    - Tool switcher: two `ToggleButton`s (Pen / Eraser) with a code-behind
      mutex — cleaner than `RadioButtons` here because it can render as a
      visibly-pressed toggle pair without an item template and matches how
      most drawing apps show the active tool. Extra tools (Line / Arrow /
      Rect / Ellipse / Text) exist in the FFI; M3-A wires their spec §3
      shortcut keys (U / A / R / O / T) through akapen_resolve_key with a
      StatusText stub, and the M3-B/C/D chapters add the real UI.
    - Color palette: 10 swatches (MS Paint 上段) are built in code from
      PaletteColors.cs into the `ColorSwatchRoot` StackPanel (5 per row × 2
      rows). Placing swatches in code keeps color literals out of XAML: a
      palette swap only touches PaletteColors.cs. Arbitrary-color picking
      (WinUI ColorPicker) is M3.
    - Size slider: `Minimum=1, Maximum=50, Value=10` per spec §3 defaults.
      Live px value shown next to the label. `[` / `]` shortcuts step by ±1
      via the M3-A KeyDown → akapen_resolve_key → BRUSH_SMALLER/LARGER path
      (see MainWindow.xaml.cs::OnRootKeyDown; the M2-D interim
      RegisterGlobalAccelerators shims have been removed).
    - Undo / Redo: sit on the toolbar. Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y / Ctrl+Shift+Z now
      route through the M3-A KeyDown → akapen_resolve_key path (single core
      key map for both shells), so the earlier per-button KeyboardAccelerators
      are removed to keep exactly one dispatch path for these keys.
    - SidePanel はまず固定サイズ(192 DIP)の右列で置く。mac は
      `.overlay(alignment: .trailing)` の半透明フローティング(hover で
      opacity 0.4→0.97 に戻る)だが、Windows の WinUI 3 でフローティング
      + fade を組み立てる価値は M2-D の受け入れバーを超えるので、後続の
      refine 候補として apps/windows/README.md に明記した(M3 相当)。
    - `RootGrid` に `x:Name` を付けたのは、M3-A で code-behind の
      `RootGrid.KeyDown` ハンドラを介して全ショートカットを
      akapen_resolve_key へ流すため(mac シェルの CanvasNSView.keyDown と
      同型)。M2-D 時代の KeyboardAccelerators.Add(...) 経路は撤去済み。

  Design notes on M2-F scope:
    - Prev/Next: same shape as Undo/Redo — a Button per direction with a
      plain `Click` handler. The PageUp/PageDown shortcuts route through
      the M3-A KeyDown → akapen_resolve_key path (NEXT_FRAME/PREV_FRAME),
      so the earlier per-button KeyboardAccelerators are removed to keep
      exactly one dispatch path. Enable/disable state
      (`MainWindow.xaml.cs::UpdateStepButtonsEnabled`) reflects whether the
      current image sits strictly inside its natural-sorted sibling sequence
      (spec §4.5): first frame disables Prev, last disables Next, a lone
      file with no siblings disables both.
    - Stepping auto-saves any unsaved strokes first (no confirmation dialog,
      spec §4.5) and aborts the step — keeping the current frame — if that
      save fails, matching the mac shell's AppState.step(forward:) data-loss
      guard. The same guard runs before Open… replaces the image.

  Design notes on M3-A scope:
    - Full spec §3 shortcut table routes through akapen_resolve_key so both
      shells share one core key map (mac CanvasNSView.keyDown 相当)。
      RootGrid の `KeyDown` ハンドラで ch / physical / primary / shift /
      alt / composing / text_editing を組み立て、返された AKAPEN_ACT_* を
      dispatch する。実装済 (M2-D/M2-F 相当) の 8 アクション
      (TOOL_PEN/ERASER, UNDO/REDO, BRUSH_SMALLER/LARGER, NEXT/PREV_FRAME)
      は既存経路へ振り分け、未実装の 16 アクション (残り 5 tool + zoom /
      rotate / 色モデル) は StatusText へ「後続 M3 章で実装」を出すだけの
      stub 経路。Ctrl+, は akapen_resolve_key に該当 ACT が無いので
      OnRootKeyDown 内で EnsureSettingsWindow への特別分岐として拾う。
      Ctrl+S は spec §3 の「primary+letter は OS/menu 譲り」に従い keymap.rs
      が NONE を返すので、既存の SaveButton の KeyboardAccelerator を残して
      OS 由来の tooltip / access key と自然に共存させている。

  非回帰:
    - Ctrl+S / SaveButton, SwapChainPanel 一式, palm gate, pressure warning
      は M2-A / M2-B1 のまま(コード側の handler と field 名も同じ)。
    - 座標変換は `panel.ActualWidth/Height` を都度読むので、右列に固定幅の
      SidePanel が入っても render surface の実サイズがそのまま反映され、
      追加補正は不要。
-->
<Window
    x:Class="AkapenApp.MainWindow"
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
    xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
    xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
    mc:Ignorable="d"
    Title="Akapen">
    <Grid x:Name="RootGrid" KeyDown="OnRootKeyDown">
        <Grid.RowDefinitions>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="*"/>
            <RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
        </Grid.RowDefinitions>

        <!-- ── Toolbar: Open / Save | Pen / Eraser | Undo / Redo. Ctrl+S は M2-A
             と同じく SaveButton に貼る。Undo / Redo の Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y (+ mac
             慣習の Ctrl+Shift+Z) は各ボタンの KeyboardAccelerators に。 ── -->
        <StackPanel Grid.Row="0" Orientation="Horizontal" Padding="12,8" Spacing="8">
            <Button x:Name="OpenButton" Content="Open…" Click="OnOpenClick"/>
            <Button x:Name="SaveButton" Content="Save" Click="OnSaveClick" IsEnabled="False">
                <Button.KeyboardAccelerators>
                    <!-- Codex Ch.9 review (Medium): unlike Ctrl+Z/Y/Shift+Z below,
                         Ctrl+S deliberately keeps its pre-existing unguarded
                         behavior — Save is expected to work even while a future
                         text-input control (Text tool / Settings, both M3) has
                         focus, matching how Ctrl+S behaves inside a text field in
                         most apps. See MainWindow.xaml.cs's IsTextInputFocused doc
                         for the guard the other 主要行 accelerators do use. -->
                    <KeyboardAccelerator Modifiers="Control" Key="S"/>
                </Button.KeyboardAccelerators>
            </Button>

            <AppBarSeparator/>

            <!-- ツール切替: ToggleButton 対で選択中を視覚化。code-behind で相互
                 排他を強制し、押されているボタンをもう一度クリックしても外れない
                 (どちらか必ず選択)ようにする。 -->
            <ToggleButton x:Name="PenToolButton"
                          Content="Pen"
                          IsChecked="True"
                          Click="OnPenToolClick"
                          ToolTipService.ToolTip="Pen (P)"
                          AutomationProperties.Name="Pen tool"/>
            <ToggleButton x:Name="EraserToolButton"
                          Content="Eraser"
                          Click="OnEraserToolClick"
                          ToolTipService.ToolTip="Eraser (E)"
                          AutomationProperties.Name="Eraser tool"/>

            <AppBarSeparator/>

            <!-- M3-A: Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Y / Ctrl+Shift+Z route through
                 OnRootKeyDown → akapen_resolve_key → dispatch, so no
                 per-button KeyboardAccelerator here. Tooltip still spells
                 the shortcut for discoverability. -->
            <Button x:Name="UndoButton"
                    Content="Undo"
                    Click="OnUndoClick"
                    IsEnabled="False"
                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="Undo (Ctrl+Z)"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Undo"/>
            <Button x:Name="RedoButton"
                    Content="Redo"
                    Click="OnRedoClick"
                    IsEnabled="False"
                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="Redo (Ctrl+Y / Ctrl+Shift+Z)"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Redo"/>

            <AppBarSeparator/>

            <!-- M2-F: 連番次前 (spec §4.5 / §3 主要ナビ行). Gated in code-behind
                 (UpdateStepButtonsEnabled) on an engine being loaded and the
                 current image sitting strictly between the sequence's first
                 and last entries — first frame disables Prev, last frame
                 disables Next.
                 M3-A: PageUp/PageDown route through OnRootKeyDown →
                 akapen_resolve_key → dispatch (AKAPEN_ACT_PREV/NEXT_FRAME),
                 so no per-button KeyboardAccelerator here — same reasoning
                 as the Undo/Redo buttons above. -->
            <Button x:Name="PrevButton"
                    Content="◀ Prev"
                    Click="OnPrevClick"
                    IsEnabled="False"
                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="Previous frame (Page Up)"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Previous frame"/>
            <Button x:Name="NextButton"
                    Content="Next ▶"
                    Click="OnNextClick"
                    IsEnabled="False"
                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="Next frame (Page Down)"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Next frame"/>

            <AppBarSeparator/>

            <!-- M2-E (spec §4.7): 出力先モード・接尾辞・固定パスなどのユーザー設定
                 を編集する独立トップレベルウィンドウを開く。mac の
                 SettingsView(Settings シーン、Cmd+, で開く)を写像。M3-A で
                 Ctrl+, は OnRootKeyDown 内の特別分岐(akapen_resolve_key に
                 該当 ACT が無いため keymap 経由には載せない)で拾って
                 EnsureSettingsWindow を叩く。IsTextInputFocused ガードは
                 従来と同じ運用で、text-input が focus 中の Ctrl+, は素通り。 -->
            <Button x:Name="SettingsButton"
                    Content="Settings…"
                    Click="OnSettingsClick"
                    ToolTipService.ToolTip="Output directory / suffix settings (Ctrl+,)"
                    AutomationProperties.Name="Settings"/>
        </StackPanel>

        <!-- ── Canvas + SidePanel の 2 カラム(Grid.Row 1)。SwapChainPanel は
             左カラム(*)、SidePanel は右カラム(Auto、内側で Width=192 に固定)。
             座標マッピングは SwapChainPanel.ActualWidth/Height を都度読むので、
             右列に SidePanel が入っても render surface の実寸に追従する。 ── -->
        <Grid Grid.Row="1">
            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>

            <!-- Render surface. M2-A / M2-B1 の handler・属性は非回帰。 -->
            <SwapChainPanel
                x:Name="RenderSurface"
                Grid.Column="0"
                Background="#262626"
                ManipulationMode="None"
                Loaded="OnRenderSurfaceLoaded"
                Unloaded="OnRenderSurfaceUnloaded"
                SizeChanged="OnRenderSurfaceSizeChanged"
                PointerPressed="OnRenderSurfacePointerPressed"
                PointerMoved="OnRenderSurfacePointerMoved"
                PointerReleased="OnRenderSurfacePointerReleased"
                PointerCaptureLost="OnRenderSurfacePointerCaptureLost"
                PointerCanceled="OnRenderSurfacePointerCanceled"/>

            <!-- SidePanel: mac の SidePanelView 相当。 -->
            <Border Grid.Column="1"
                    Width="192"
                    BorderBrush="#3a3a3a"
                    BorderThickness="1,0,0,0">
                <StackPanel Padding="12" Spacing="12">
                    <!-- サイズ(1〜50 px)。スライダー右に現在値を数値表示。
                         `[` / `]` ショートカットで NudgeSize(±1) が Slider.Value
                         を書き替え、ValueChanged 経由で akapen_set_size を呼ぶ。 -->
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Vertical" Spacing="4">
                        <Grid>
                            <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                                <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                            </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                            <TextBlock Grid.Column="0"
                                       Text="サイズ"
                                       FontSize="12"/>
                            <TextBlock x:Name="SizeValueText"
                                       Grid.Column="1"
                                       Text="10 px"
                                       FontSize="12"
                                       FontFamily="Consolas"/>
                        </Grid>
                        <Slider x:Name="SizeSlider"
                                Minimum="1"
                                Maximum="50"
                                Value="10"
                                StepFrequency="1"
                                ValueChanged="OnSizeSliderChanged"
                                AutomationProperties.Name="Brush size"/>
                    </StackPanel>

                    <Border Height="1" Background="#3a3a3a"/>

                    <!-- 色: PaletteColors から動的に生成された10個の Button
                         スウォッチが code-behind で 5x2 のレイアウトで積まれる。 -->
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Vertical" Spacing="6">
                        <TextBlock Text="色" FontSize="12"/>
                        <StackPanel x:Name="ColorSwatchRoot"
                                    Orientation="Vertical"
                                    Spacing="6"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                </StackPanel>
            </Border>
        </Grid>

        <!-- ── Status bar. M2-A / M2-B1 のまま(StatusText と PressureWarningText
             が同じ行に共存し、右詰め警告と save/open メッセージが互いを潰さない構図)。 ── -->
        <Border Grid.Row="2" BorderBrush="#3a3a3a" BorderThickness="0,1,0,0">
            <Grid>
                <Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
                    <ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
                </Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
                <TextBlock
                    x:Name="StatusText"
                    Grid.Column="0"
                    Padding="12,6"
                    FontSize="12"
                    Text="Open an image (Ctrl+O or the Open… button) to begin."/>
                <TextBlock
                    x:Name="PressureWarningText"
                    Grid.Column="1"
                    Padding="12,6"
                    FontSize="12"
                    Foreground="Orange"
                    Visibility="Collapsed"
                    Text="Pressure not detected — check the tablet driver / pen pressure settings."/>
            </Grid>
        </Border>
    </Grid>
</Window>
